  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/04/P1570260.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p>Aquest diumenge, 23 d&#39;abril, s&#39;ha celebrat a la pla&ccedil;a Major de Suera una nova edici&oacute; del Dia del Llibre, organitzat pel Centre Cultural. S&#39;ha pogut comprar llibres, acompanyats cadascun d&#39;un clavell, i tamb&eacute; s&#39;han sortejat diversos exemplars.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diallibresuera17/p1570253.jpg\" alt=\"p1570253\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diallibresuera17/p1570255.jpg\" alt=\"p1570255\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diallibresuera17/p1570258.jpg\" alt=\"p1570258\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diallibresuera17/p1570260.jpg\" alt=\"p1570260\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /></div>"
